# Module TotpAuth - en_US
ModuleTotpAuthName = Two-factor authentication (TOTP)
TotpAuthDescription = Two-factor login with time-based one-time codes (TOTP): Google Authenticator, Aegis, FreeOTP, Bitwarden, 1Password…
TotpAuthDescriptionLong = Adds a second factor after the password: 6-digit code from an authenticator app (RFC 6238), recovery codes, lockout after repeated failures and optional mandatory enrollment.
Permission50071001 = Reset the second factor of other users

